#==============================================================================================
#
#   available_space - Layout::AvailableSize and Layout::AvailableSpace: the space a box is laid
#                     out in (definite, indefinite, or a min-/max-content constraint)
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Layout/AvailableSpace.cpp (lines 1-59) and the inline members of
#       AvailableSpace.h (lines 1-114): the four kinds of available size, their comparisons with
#       CSSPixels and their debug strings.
